WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.930
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.410
...crazy about you!

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:45.360
Momo-chan!

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:48.590
Morning, Momo-chan.

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:49.590
Morning!

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:51.530
Let's go check out the
new class assignments.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:02.210
Dear God and Buddha, please let me
be in a different class from Sae!

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:04.880
Oh, there it is! Class 2-3.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:06.870
"'Adachi Momo"'

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:08.440
"'Okayasu Kairi"'

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:11.820
Yay! We're in the same class, Momo-chan!

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:15.220
"'Kashiwagi Sae"'

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:25.360
"'Tojigamori Kazuya"'

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:31.410
"'The Peach Flower, Blossomed?"'

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:39.420
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:39.920
I'm in the same class with Toji again!

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:44.920
Oh boy, give me a break. Am l going to have
to put up with that for another year again?

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:48.930
Gosh, look at her.
Flirting with him just to show off.

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:52.260
So who cares? Let them do what they want.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:55.940
Yeah, but doesn't it piss you off?

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:58.840
Not really. It's all in the past anyway.

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:03.360
lt's over with Toji.

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:09.880
lt's been three months since we broke up.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:11.320
When we pass each other in the hall,

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:14.180
we don't even look or speak
to each other anymore.

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:19.230
As we start 11th grade, l was hoping to
be in a different class from those two,

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:23.900
so that l could make a fresh new start,

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:26.520
but talk about bad luck.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:30.240
"'Discuss outdoor field trip
-divide into groups -assign duties"'

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:32.910
So what shall we do for our cookout?

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:35.910
How about a barbecue? That's easy.

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:37.580
Yeah, that sounds good.

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:38.910
--I agree!
--I agree!

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:40.910
All right, then it's decided.

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:43.580
You don't have to do a thing, Sae-chan.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:46.140
Yeah, we'll carry all your bags for you.

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:52.260
When l'm with Okayasu,
Sae stays away from me.

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:55.260
Sae regards Okayasu as her natural enemy.

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:59.320
Okayasu knows that too, so he
sticks around to shield me from her.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:06.190
l can relax when l'm with Okayasu.

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:11.400
But l've had enough of love for a while.

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:18.880
Does everyone have their belongings
from the bus?

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:20.550
--Yes!
--Yes!
--Yes!

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:22.050
All right, then let's go.

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:30.220
Momo-chan, Momo-chan!

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:34.230
Let's try to have
some alone time later, okay?

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:35.230
How come?

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:38.240
I mean, look around you.
These mountains, this vast nature!

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:40.610
Doesn't it make you feel free and open?

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:43.670
While you're at it,
open yourself up to me, and...

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:46.010
In your dreams!

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:51.680
You seem to be in
much better spirits, Adachi.

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:54.920
Yeah, lately you've been
laughing a lot more too.

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:56.590
I'm so glad.

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:57.920
You think so?

00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:03.200
Sure. At one point, it was hard to even
look at you. You were totally in the pits.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.200
You just looked defeated.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:08.530
Oh! Please stop talking about that!

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:10.540
You owe it all to Okayasu, don't you?

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:12.870
Come on, tell us. What's really
going on between the two of you?

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.540
Are you guys going out?

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.880
No, he's just a friend!

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:18.540
Aw, come on.

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:19.550
Really?

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:20.880
No, really!

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:22.880
You made it, Sae-chan.

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:23.550
Here's some tea.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.220
The meat's ready.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:26.890
Toji...

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:30.910
My hand's dirty. Get a wet towel for me.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.230
Are you really going out
with him, Sae-chan?

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:39.230
He's like your slave.

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.500
Isn't that great?

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:45.460
Toji does everything I tell him to
because he's madly in love with me.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:01.520
Adachi! Can you bring us some oil?

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:03.190
This one?

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:04.180
Yeah, that's the one.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:18.560
Momo-chan!

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:22.880
You okay, Adachi?

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.880
Yeah... I just got a little burned.

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:27.900
Hurry! Cool it down with some water.

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:41.230
You're still in love
with Momo-chan, aren't you?

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:47.430
You looked like you wanted to go help her.
Are you upset that Okayasu beat you to it?

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:56.140
Don't just stand there
like a dummy. Say something!

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:02.440
Kiss me.

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:08.850
Do you get it?
You're my boyfriend, you know!

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:10.410
Okay, this should do it.

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:13.190
Thank you.

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:14.190
Be careful now.

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:15.860
You sure are a klutz, Momo-chan.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:18.020
Well, excuse me!

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:22.670
Was it just my imagination?
lt felt like someone pushed me.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.640
But Sae was sitting down...

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:27.870
Yuck...

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:31.170
Come on guys... don't do
that kind of stuff here.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.220
Let's go, Okayasu. Everyone's waiting.

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:42.710
Y- yeah...

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:53.460
What? No reaction?

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:56.900
You moron!

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:06.810
Come on, Momo-chan. Open up!

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:10.850
Delicious!

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:12.520
Okay, my turn, my turn! Ahhn!

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:14.190
What's gotten into you, Adachi?

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:16.860
Yeah, you're beyond happy.
You're like hyper.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:21.090
Oh yeah? Really? Come on guys,
there's a lot more. Eat up!

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:26.490
Lemme wipe that
stupid smile off your face!

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:31.000
Okayasu's groupies?

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:35.210
Hey, aren't you being a little wishy-washy?

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:40.210
When you were going out with Tojigamori,
you didn't even give Kairi the time of day.

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:42.550
So don't go hanging
around him now. Got that?

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:44.880
Yeah, you're annoying us.

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:45.880
Let's go.

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:48.220
Yeah, Kairi has always
been our one and only.

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:49.590
--That's right.
--That's right.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:57.560
Phew, it's over.

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:59.230
That was fast.

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:01.170
Come on, let's go back.

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:02.500
Huh? Where's Adachi?

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:06.170
The restroom. She said
go on ahead, she'll catch up.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:09.170
Oh yeah? Well, Okayasu's there.
She'll be okay.

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:12.180
Maybe we should
give them some time alone...

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:13.510
Good idea.

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:15.850
What? Really?

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:18.850
Momo-chan already left?

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:21.520
That's right. She went
with Ogawa-san and the others.

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:24.180
So you come with us, Kairi!

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:34.870
Hey, aren't you being a little wishy-washy?

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:39.200
l wonder if l've been taking advantage
of Okayasu's kindness.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:42.470
lf Okayasu still has feelings for me,

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:45.200
and that's why
he's being nice to me, then...

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:50.580
...am l just being cruel to him?

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:55.580
Huh? Where is everybody?

00:09:58.220 --> 00:09:58.690
Shoot! I wasn't paying attention! Guys!

00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:02.090
"'Base of Mountain"'
Shoot! I wasn't paying attention! Guys!

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:06.190
"'Base of Mountain"'

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:09.030
Take care!

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:18.010
Huh? How weird. Where is everybody?

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:23.580
I should've caught up to the people
in front of me a long time ago.

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:27.680
Hmm? Wait now,
did I pass this on my way up?

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:36.930
Which way did l come from?

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:47.440
What am l going to do? l have to
get back to the road l was on before.

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:53.950
Ouch!

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:56.310
What on earth?

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:01.390
Ouch!!

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.560
Huh?

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.890
--Where's Momo-chan?
--Where's Adachi?

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:09.560
I thought you were with her.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:12.230
I heard you left with her.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.990
Hang on there!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:19.530
Care to explain?

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:27.580
I can't... I can't walk...

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:30.580
Okayasu!! Kako!!

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:34.420
Nami!! Ritsuko!!

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:45.930
A light... A light!

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:50.130
A light! I'm saved! Saved-

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:11.560
Why? Why did this happen to me?

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:13.080
Toji...

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:29.580
Toji... l'm still in love with Toji.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:33.530
Even after the breakup,
even after the way he treated me.

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:37.840
Toji!

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:49.420
Lemme wipe that
stupid smile off your face!

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:55.600
Of course, it still hurts.
lt kills me every time l see him.

00:12:55.600 --> 00:13:01.540
Even so, l'm still trying
to move forward... but... but...

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:03.370
Momo-chan, there you are!

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:30.240
See, I knew you'd be crying.

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.900
Oh... um... uh...

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:37.580
What a fool you are to get lost.
Huh? Did you hurt your leg?

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:40.410
A... fool? Who are you calling a fool?

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:49.920
Sorry.

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:53.480
You must've been so scared
to be out here all alone.

00:13:57.930 --> 00:14:01.870
Why? Every time I'm feeling vulnerable,
you're there.

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:03.630
It's not fair...

00:14:18.550 --> 00:14:22.540
Don't, Okayasu. Don't be nice to me.

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:29.520
Have l fallen for him again?

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:40.390
But... was that how a kiss feels?

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.800
Bye, I'm off!

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:51.580
No... The kiss l remember...

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:55.990
...grips the core of your body
so tightly that it almost hurts.

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:00.880
lt was much more.

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:07.920
You stupid dog!

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:13.230
Was kissing Okayasu kinda like that?

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:17.880
Sorry, Okayasu...

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:21.810
l wonder how Okayasu
feels about yesterday?

00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:27.220
Yes, yes, yes, yes! Yes!

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:29.890
We'll be on the school
beautification committee!

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:31.220
Wait a minute...

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:36.060
If we don't decide quickly, we might be on
the same committee as Sae-chan and Toji.

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:42.230
Oh man, sorry about that. Who knew
we'd have to take care of the garden?

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:44.900
I thought there wouldn't be
much to do on this committee.

00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:47.770
Momo-chan? Momo-chan!

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:58.920
What do l want to do?
Am l in love with Okayasu?

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:02.250
Or am l just using him because
it feels comfortable being with him?

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:04.780
Ouch!

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:11.530
Um... let's see. Here it is.

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:12.860
I'm all set.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:16.590
Boy, I'm such a klutz.

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:24.730
Toji's still here...

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.200
Toji's desk...

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:35.890
Come on, it's not like you have
anything to do at home, right?

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.890
Well, think about it. Okay, Toji?

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:38.890
Yeah...

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:41.150
N... no way! Toji?!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:51.240
Hey, Toji.

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:55.240
The captain wants to talk to you.
You have a minute?

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:57.300
Yeah, okay.

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:08.850
l can't do this. l still have
such strong feelings for Toji.

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:10.950
l can't go out with Okayasu.

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:18.330
l'm feeling so conflicted that
l'll end up hurting Okayasu again.

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:25.030
But losing Okayasu would be
too hard for me right now.

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:30.540
How do l really feel about Okayasu?

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:33.550
Maybe l need to kiss him
again to find out...

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:36.880
Oh my God! What am I thinking?!

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:40.940
Momo-chan! Where were you?
I missed you!

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:50.560
Oops, that was too hard...

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:51.830
--Oh shucks...
--Oh shucks...
--Oh shucks...

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:53.900
--and we just finished planting those...

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:55.390
I'm sorry.

00:17:57.900 --> 00:18:00.840
Oh man, the two of us
have to stay overtime?

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:04.610
Well, it's okay. I don't mind spending
time alone with you, Momo-chan.

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:10.520
Oh yeah, Momo-chan,

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:14.850
I wanted to show you something. Here!

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:17.190
Wow, that's a big dried plum seed.

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:20.860
Very funny. It's a peach pit. A peach pit.

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:22.860
I know that.

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:24.530
Well, you know, um...

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:28.200
I brought it with me so we can secretly
plant it. Come on, let's do it together.

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:30.000
To commemorate being
in the same class this year.

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:38.540
Momo-chan, are you angry
that I kissed you the other day?

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:39.540
Not really...

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:44.880
Don't lie! You've been really
cold to me! I bet you're angry.

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:47.220
I'm not angry.

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:51.220
Then how come you're so cold to me?
Tell me, why? Why? Why?

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:54.230
Because I don't know!

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:56.230
Don't know, what?

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:57.990
How I feel...

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:03.800
Frankly speaking, Okayasu,

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:05.840
I'm just totally taking advantage
of your kindness right now.

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:09.170
That's an easy way out for me,
and it feels comfortable.

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:13.180
But it's not doing me
any good at all in the long run.

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:15.180
Why isn't it doing you any good?

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:18.520
Because I still have feelings for Toji,

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:22.190
but when it's convenient for me,
I ask you to bail me out, Okayasu.

00:19:22.190 --> 00:19:25.320
I just keep taking the easy way out

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:27.990
and I'm doing nothing
to get back on my feet on my own.

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:35.870
Sorry, Okayasu... I'm still
in love with Toji.

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:39.470
I think of you as more
than just a friend, Okayasu.

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:43.540
But I don't even know myself...

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:45.440
...if that's love or not.

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:52.350
What, that's it? But you want
to be with me, right?

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:53.890
Then what's wrong with that?

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:57.560
I may only be using you, Okayasu!

00:19:57.560 --> 00:19:59.490
And that's okay with me.

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:02.560
This is you, Momo-chan.

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:06.700
It's been winter all along for you,
but spring has finally arrived,

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:08.390
and flowers will start blooming.

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:12.440
But in order for flowers to bloom,

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:16.240
they need help from the earth's nutrients,
water and sunshine.

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:22.650
You don't have to do this alone. You should
depend more on those around you. Okay?

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:31.590
l was so happy, l thought
l was going to cry.

00:20:31.590 --> 00:20:36.790
Will that day ever come for me?
The day l will blossom?

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:43.600
Momo-chan, hurry, hurry!

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:44.940
What on earth is it?!

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:46.940
Never mind, just come.

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:49.200
See? Look!

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:05.190
Isn't that amazing?! It's only been
one week since we planted it,

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:06.220
and it bloomed already!

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:08.230
It's a miracle!

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:10.330
I bet the peach blossom wanted to tell you

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:14.900
that you should stay
just the way you are, Momo-chan.

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:17.570
You know, Momo-chan...

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:20.130
I don't care if you're
still in love with Toji.

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:24.210
I just want to be by your side.

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:30.580
Thanks, Okayasu...

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:31.580
But...

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:35.920
...why did we get a quince flower
when we planted a peach pit?

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:40.590
This is a quince flower.
Peach blossoms don't look like this.

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:44.820
No way! The old man next door
said this was a peach!

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:48.930
I knew it.

00:21:48.930 --> 00:21:50.730
You're so easy.

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:56.510
So I'm just a "'blooming idiot,"' huh?

00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:07.550
Oh I just remembered. There is
a peach blossom here. Right here.

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:11.220
Do you know, Momo-chan,
what the meaning of "'peach blossom"' is?

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:14.280
I am your captive...

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:21.190
I am... your captive.

00:22:36.980 --> 00:22:42.990
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:42.990 --> 00:22:52.660
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.660 --> 00:22:55.670
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.670 --> 00:23:02.270
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.270 --> 00:23:08.610
Where can we go

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:18.290
where we can all be

00:23:18.290 --> 00:23:20.960
under the same sky?

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:29.300
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:35.970
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:42.310
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.310 --> 00:23:49.660
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.660 --> 00:23:57.820
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.270 --> 00:24:04.940
Now that l think about it,
l don't know a thing about Okayasu.

00:24:04.940 --> 00:24:07.270
Who's that girl? ls she
the one in the picture?

00:24:07.270 --> 00:24:08.510
Why is she hugging you all of a sudden?

00:24:08.510 --> 00:24:11.280
Why does she know
so much about you, Okayasu?

00:24:11.280 --> 00:24:14.970
Next on Peach Girl,
"'Shock! An Ex-Girlfriend Barges In!?"'
